>look at the sketch
It is a drawing, in your own clumsy pencil, of a girl with a way of tilting her
head as if the world were a question she meant to answer later. Fenchurch. You
have drawn her at least forty times and never once got the tilt right. She
vanished in the middle of a hyperspace jump, which is a thing that happens, and
which nobody has ever satisfactorily explained to you.

[The score has just gone up by two points.]

>wear the gown
