>what should i do?
[Hint 1 of 4] Hob will want sourberries, and they grow on the slope south of the
green.

>how do i make a sandwich
You are very good at them: bread, then whatever the customer actually wants, no
more and no less. People on Lamuella have views about this. Try MAKE A SANDWICH
WITH MEAT AND SOURBERRIES, or ASK a customer what they like.

